# cabin_guestbook_open: the guest book lying open on the porch table, on
# the first launch and after a death (GAME_DESIGN 2.2, 12.4): two pale
# pages with a line of older handwriting, an ink spine and an ink lower
# edge (the page block), and its bark cover showing at one side, so it
# reads against the day's wall and the lit pane behind it alike. The
# anchor, 0,0, is at_guestbook, the table's top.
C 4  L -2,-2 -1,-2  L 1,-2 2,-2  L -2,-1 -1,-1  L 1,-1 2,-1
C 0  L 0,-2 0,-1  L -2,0 2,0
C 10  L -3,-1 -3,0
C 2  L -2,-1  L 2,-2
